%-----------SUMMARY-----------------

\section{Professional Summary}

\small{
Machine Learning Engineer with 4+ years of experience delivering computer-vision, data-platform, and edge-AI systems from prototype through production. Built systems that reduced false positives by 30\%, cut cloud costs by 15\%, improved real-time inference speed by 2.5$\times$, and removed manual device-provisioning work at scale. Strong in data-centric AI, embedded development, MLOps, and turning technically difficult requirements into working production systems.
}

